  and every day you walk to a different  place until you feel that you know the  area  very well because this person is  supposed to have been  raised there so you learn as much as  possible and when you don't know a  detail  you find in the area a detail that is  good enough for it  for instance you don't know exactly the  school they went to but there is a  school in the area so  this is the school you mentioned when  you are being asked  you really have to to believe that you  are this other  other person  [Music]  one very important thing to act while  being interrogated is never be  aggressive never be conceited  never show that you are too sure of  yourself  a be humble be nice be friendly  be naive even pretend to not understand  too much  and act natural towards the situation as  if it was something  completely natural that everybody else  is is going through  and if he starts to like you because  you're nice  and maybe if he can feel even sorry for  you that you're  maybe a bit scared or frightened and  then he's on your side  he does not want to break you you have  to really  to act very carefully so it's not to  bring him to a place where he wants to  show you  who is the stronger of the two  whenever you go into a place into a  store or something you are all the time  watching for escape routes just in case  it becomes part of your nature like uh  like noticing  people around you noticing who's  watching you who is talking to you you  just  you're more alert than people usually  are  if force comes to worse you have an  escape plan  of course you have a set of clothes that  are completely different you change your  appearance  you change your papers and you take a  car and you cross the border  or you have an aircraft coming to rescue  you  or you go out to sea and wait for to  being rescued  or you are helped by another agency  in the area who smuggle you out of the  country there are many different ways to  do that  you're always prepared to grab your 